---
layout: page
title: Private Landlord progress
description: Progress, risks and decisions for the Possession Claims Service Private Landlord workstream.
---
{% set t = roadmap.latest.totals if roadmap.latest %}
<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Overall status {{ overview.rag | ragTag }}</h2>
<p class="govuk-body-l">{{ overview.headline }}</p>
<p class="govuk-body-s">Status updated {{ overview.updated | date }}.</p>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">At a glance</h2>
<dl class="govuk-summary-list">
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Epics done</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{% if t and t.epics %}{{ t.epicsDone }} of {{ t.epics }}{% else %}No epics yet{% endif %}</dd></div>
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Work items done</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{% if t and t.items %}{{ t.itemsDone }} of {{ t.items }} ({{ (t.itemsDone / t.items * 100) | round }}%){% else %}No work items yet{% endif %}</dd></div>
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Open risks and issues</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{{ raid | where("status", "open") | length }} (<a class="govuk-link" href="/raid/">RAID log</a>)</dd></div>
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Product and design decisions</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{{ decisions | length }}, {{ decisions | where("outcome", "open-question") | length }} still open (<a class="govuk-link" href="/decisions/">Decisions log</a>)</dd></div>
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Non-functional requirements</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{{ nfrs.nfrs | length }} (<a class="govuk-link" href="/nfrs/">NFRs</a>)</dd></div>
<div class="govuk-summary-list__row"><dt class="govuk-summary-list__key">Dependency clashes</dt>
<dd class="govuk-summary-list__value">{{ roadmap.latest.clashes | length if roadmap.latest else 0 }}</dd></div>
</dl>

<h2 class="govuk-heading-l">Next milestones</h2>
{% set upcoming = [] %}
{% for m in overview.milestones | sort(false, false, "date") %}{% if m.date >= build.today %}{% set upcoming = (upcoming.push(m), upcoming) %}{% endif %}{% endfor %}
{% if upcoming | length %}
<table class="govuk-table"><thead class="govuk-table__head"><tr class="govuk-table__row">
<th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Date</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Milestone</th><th scope="col" class="govuk-table__header">Status</th></tr></thead>
<tbody class="govuk-table__body">
{% for m in upcoming | batch(5) | first %}<tr class="govuk-table__row"><td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ m.date | date }}</td><td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ m.title }}</td><td class="govuk-table__cell">{{ m.status }}</td></tr>
{% endfor %}</tbody></table>
{% else %}
<p class="govuk-body">No milestones have been set yet.</p>
{% endif %}

{% include "data-notice.njk" %}
